{"server":"tw","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_02_end","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_02","title":"同車異圖","storyCode":"RS-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"ded933712b1d2e7a765aacfab5dab9c8823313d9bbc1fb5530342e090e6d21af","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"快看，外面看得到雪山！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊這也太近了吧，這是不是謝拉格的聖山？不管是不是，這景色都太美了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我說啊，能不能先把窗戶關上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"風、風有點大，吹得我說話都、都有點不太流利了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"也不至於這麼誇張吧，我覺得也不是不能忍忍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的，你真的不冷嗎？我看你甚至沒穿褲子——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"建議你好好想一下用詞，再這麼說下去我就要告你亂調侃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我穿的這是保暖褲襪，最厚的那一種！比你那身暖和多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲……好好好，你說是，那就是吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。快，你再站過來點，我要拍照了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你有沒有聽到什麼聲音……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們先生們，日安，日安"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉打擾各位的觀光休閒！麻煩各位暫時回到坐席稍作避讓，我們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了這種時候了就別廢話了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起各位，借過一下，麻煩都借過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅莎琳！這樣有點太失禮了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，哎，羅莎琳，輕一點拉，我的袖子要被你拉下來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這是什麼謝拉格風俗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也要這樣在列車裡跑跑看嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能有這種風俗吧？感覺好蠢，我才不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，還是先把合照拍了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"看鏡頭！三……二……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"一……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不討厭這種追逐遊戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我談不上喜歡。我們不能坐下來好好談嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們自己坐賊心虛，一直在跑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好繼續跑，別停下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，順便一說，再等五分鐘才是外面風景最好的路段，合照可以之後再拍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩得開心一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那又是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你剛剛說得可能有道理，謝拉格搞不好確實有什麼要在列車上疾跑一圈的風俗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，呃，要不然還是入境隨俗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼了，從剛剛起在發什麼呆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我的照片，我的照片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"發抖的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"照片怎麼了？剛剛那人說再過五分鐘風景更好，我看我們還是再等等看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"不是說這個！你看這張照片！我正好拍到剛剛那位姐姐的正臉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我總覺得她看起來有點眼熟，好像在哪見過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"算了不重要！重點是她、她這身正裝，未免也太帥了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精神很好的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"我要珍藏這張照片！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來跟大家介紹一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我們謝拉格最有名的乳酪鍋，用的是我們當地特產的好乳酪，風味醇厚，保管謝拉格之外的地方都沒有這樣的滋味！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"真有這麼好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快快，再快點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等等，羅莎琳……呃咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失禮了女士們先生們，乳酪鍋的味道確實不錯，我推薦加點胡椒風味更濃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好客的老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼還來？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"……這就是謝拉格的列車旅行嗎，果然如我的朋友們說的那樣，別有特色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，加了胡椒果然不錯，我喜歡這個味道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，齊了，抓齊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托各位的福，羽獸一隻都沒少。勞動各位幫忙，真不知道怎麼感謝才好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，您可把袋子綁緊囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次……這次就算了，但您千萬記好，我們的列車上是禁止帶活物的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次記得一定不能再這樣了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定的，一定的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦、哦喲，小年輕，什麼事情這麼緊急啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列車員","speakerId":"avg_npc_276_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客、客人！列車上請不要這樣奔跑！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！那個戴帽子的傢伙！你仔細點……你，哎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝拉格老鄉","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要命了，我的羽獸！我的羽獸又跑啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩惱的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"這個盲盒怎麼一直抽不到隱藏限量款！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩惱的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一次，最後再試一次……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩惱的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！走路注意點！萬一撞壞了我的盲盒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩惱的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_217","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！是、是限量款！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g2_trainwalkway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一節車廂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追逐遊戲結束？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您贏得了遊戲，這看起來已經沒有懸念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望我們能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真吵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的時間不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰禮帽”，別著急，我會記得你有這份懇談的意願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回頭我再單獨和你“談談”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己出來，別讓我動手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位大姐，姐！我在這呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，呸，地上還挺多灰……美女姐姐，你找我有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找的不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這除了我沒別人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你別亂動！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們在演什麼戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼演戲？沒沒沒有的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（欸大叔你安靜點！我這不是正在幫你遮掩嘛！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（別、別扯我的頭髮！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是羅德島的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我確實是……你知道羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，美女姐姐，難道你是博士上次來認識的熟人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"熟人？我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我沒有太多時間閒聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我耐心耗盡之前，出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小祖宗，算了算了，快放我出來吧！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能這樣幫我確實令我感動，但羅莎琳你下手也太重了點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……我的頭髮，我的鬍子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於找到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，原來你們認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢說相識，不過也曾有過幾面之緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧女士，許久不見，讓您見笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒暄就不必了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克雷加文，山上的老雷昂急著找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……老雷昂？找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等會，是老雷昂找我，而不是鐧女士您要找我……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我受他所託，來找你。就這麼一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他如此著急找我，是有何要事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，我好像確實忘了點什麼……是什麼來著……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了莉莉還在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對了，是莉莉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼莉莉……不是吧，大叔，你把你對象忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相好——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，咳咳，咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……子爵閣下，您如此行事，恐怕有損維多利亞的形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尊夫人和令千金如果知道此事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，人渣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢著！咳咳，該死的灰，不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"各位乘客，本次列車即將抵達終點站——\n銀心湖站。\n請各位乘客收拾好隨身的行李物品，從各自車廂前後車門排隊下車。\n感謝您搭乘本次列車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間耽擱得還不算久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下車後你最好盡快上山去找老雷昂，他很急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還是分道揚鑣吧，不然我媽會不高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，咳咳，莉莉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——她根本就不是人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還要罵人家不是人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不不。噗，好了，把我自己氣笑了。岔氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉是馱獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"馱獸……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我沒說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“灰禮帽”！你裝什麼裝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信你手下的探子沒把我在謝拉格的行動匯報給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，您治癒的馱獸叫什麼名字，並不在需要我記憶的重點情報之中，閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，其實大叔不是人渣，也不會有什麼危險？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又追又跑的，我以為是什麼性命攸關的大事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……唉！羅莎琳，這確實是事關我名譽的大事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想磨蹭多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別傻站著，擋路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車到站了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
